* The budget arithmetic of ` mulC_le_B ` (TM/Canon.lean) at the N level: the cost of ` mulC ` on words of lengths ` A ` (multiplicand) and ` B ` (multiplier), both at most ` M ` , is within ` ( TMB ` M ) ` (the ` mulC_runs ` bound ` B ( 4 A + 6 B + 14 ) + 4 A + 7 B + 9 ` ; ~ tmdquad at ` 10 ` ).  T7 glues it to ~ tm2fml and ~ tm2fcan at the concrete alphabet with ~ encnatlenpow for the lengths.

